bbmp: HivelyTracker's replayer (ZXTune's 3rdparty/hvl) trusted a damaged file's wave length,
waveform, stereo setting, note and position jump, and crashed (the final audit of 7 October
2026). Each is kept inside what the replayer has; real songs play byte for byte as before.
